# Backport BXM-4-64 (Radxa Cubie A7A / Allwinner A733, BVNC 36.56.104.183)
# device info into Mesa 25.0.7, whose pvr driver predates this GPU.
#
# 1. new file src/imagination/common/device_info/bxm-4-64.h, copied from Mesa
#    25.3.0 with the entries 25.0.7 cannot represent removed (listed in the
#    file itself): tpu_parallel_instances (feature added later) and the
#    brn72168 / brn72463 / brn74056 quirk flags (absent from 25.0.7's
#    struct pvr_device_quirks, which also has no workaround for them).
# 2. one case in pvr_device_info_init().
#
# Applies to: mesa-25.0.7 (also 25.1/25.2, same struct layout - verify first)
--- /dev/null
+++ b/src/imagination/common/device_info/bxm-4-64.h
