+ * Copied from Mesa 25.3.0 into 25.0.7, whose pvr driver predates BXM-4-64.
+ * struct pvr_device_info is identical between the two versions, but the
+ * sub-structs are not, so these entries were dropped because 25.0.7 has
+ * neither the field nor any workaround keyed on it:
+ *   .has_tpu_parallel_instances = true,
+ *   .tpu_parallel_instances = 4U,
+ *   .has_brn72168 = true,
+ *   .has_brn72463 = true,
