+ *   .has_brn72463 = true,
+ *   .has_brn74056 = true,
+ *
+ * The dropped BRN quirks are hardware bug workarounds. Their absence means
+ * this backport is fine for bring-up and correctness testing of the mainline
+ * driver, but is not equivalent to native 25.3 support.
+ */
